  <Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission06_Event.c1>一股徹骨的寒意湧入體內，似乎是來自某種魔藥的詛咒</Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission06_Event.c1>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission06_Event.c2>這座站點裡不穩定的魔法正在釋放，周圍的空間似乎隨時會發生改變</Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission06_Event.c2>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission06_Event.c3>不穩定的空間魔法似乎消失了，但毒霧似乎蔓延得更快了，原來空間魔法反而是控制毒霧蔓延範圍的屏障</Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission06_Event.c3>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission06_Event.c3.o1>補全並修正空間魔法結構，抑制毒霧蔓延（隨機清醒玩家立刻增長大量毒性蔓延）</Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission06_Event.c3.o1>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission06_Event.c3.o1.c1>這點代價是值得的</Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission06_Event.c3.o1.c1>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission06_Event.c3.o2>忽視這些小瑕疵</Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission06_Event.c3.o2>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission06_Event.c3.o2.c1>毒霧還要蔓延相當一段時間才會散去</Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission06_Event.c3.o2.c1>
  <!--清理魔咒污染站点-->
  <Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission07_Event.c1>哨站角落傳來奇怪的動靜，似乎有什麼危險的東西出現了</Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission07_Event.c1>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission07_Event.c2>哨站裡的急救系統竟然還能生效，鍊金噴霧瀰漫在空氣中，治癒著你的傷勢</Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission07_Event.c2>
  <!--不期而遇-->
  <Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission08_Event.c1>似乎有什麼東西被驚動了，遠處傳來低沉不斷的轟鳴聲</Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission08_Event.c1>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission08_Event.c2>一陣空曠而遼遠的古老聲音傳入你的腦海中：“你也是來追尋中心的答案的嗎？”</Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission08_Event.c2>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission08_Event.c2.o1>你是誰？</Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission08_Event.c2.o1>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission08_Event.c2.o1.c1>“旅者，請允許我這麼稱呼你，現在來觀賞歐羅巴中心的美景吧”</Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission08_Event.c2.o1.c1>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission08_Event.c2.o2>又在玩什麼把戲，這裡就是小偷藏私的窩點嗎？</Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission08_Event.c2.o2>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission08_Event.c2.o2.c1>“這裡是，歐羅巴的中心，由我來展現歐羅巴中心的絕景吧”</Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission08_Event.c2.o2.c1>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission08_Event.c2.o3>想知道木衛二的天空是什麼樣子的嗎？等反應堆把你炸上天就知道了</Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission08_Event.c2.o3>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission08_Event.c2.o3.c1>你決定不理會那股聲音，只要把反應堆炸燬，不管是什麼，都與你無關了</Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission08_Event.c2.o3.c1>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission08_Event.c3>那些失去理智的傢伙似乎已經解決得差不多了，必須炸燬這裡的反應堆，上傳這個站點的信息</Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission08_Event.c3>
  <!--进退维谷-->
  <Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission09_Event.c1>站點裡的敵人已經發現了你的存在</Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission09_Event.c1>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission09_Event.c2>來源不明的低語傳入你的耳中：“你也是來朝聖的嗎？”</Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission09_Event.c2>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission09_Event.c2.o1>忽視敵人的精神干預</Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission09_Event.c2.o1>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission09_Event.c2.o1.c1>一股未知的魔法能量刺破你的皮膚，鑽入腦海，“無知的羔羊，該做出選擇了，我會為你親手寫下詛咒”</Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission09_Event.c2.o1.c1>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission09_Event.c2.o1.c1.o1>承受詛咒（隨機玩家被詛咒）</Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission09_Event.c2.o1.c1.o1>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission09_Event.c2.o1.c1.o2>拒絕詛咒（概率不受詛咒，或所有玩家被詛咒）</Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission09_Event.c2.o1.c1.o2>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission09_Event.c2.o1.c1.o3>聽天由命（不再進行選擇，完全隨機）</Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission09_Event.c2.o1.c1.o3>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission09_Event.c2.o2>我是來調查真相的</Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission09_Event.c2.o2>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission09_Event.c2.o2.c1>一股未知的魔法能量刺破你的皮膚，鑽入腦海，“又是一份無形之神的祭品，作為禮貌，我允許你選擇不那麼痛的死法”</Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission09_Event.c2.o2.c1>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission09_Event.c2.o2.c1.o1>承受詛咒（隨機玩家被詛咒）</Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission09_Event.c2.o2.c1.o1>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission09_Event.c2.o2.c1.o2>拒絕詛咒（概率不受詛咒，或所有玩家被詛咒）</Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission09_Event.c2.o2.c1.o2>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission09_Event.c2.o2.c1.o3>聽天由命（不再進行選擇，完全隨機）</Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission09_Event.c2.o2.c1.o3>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission09_Event.c3>“無知的羔羊，該做出選擇了，我會為你親手寫下詛咒”</Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission09_Event.c3>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission09_Event.c3.o1>承受詛咒（隨機玩家被詛咒）</Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission09_Event.c3.o1>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission09_Event.c3.o2>拒絕詛咒（概率不受詛咒，或所有玩家被詛咒）</Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission09_Event.c3.o2>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission09_Event.c4>隨著詛咒的力量被釋放，那股詭異的氣息似乎也漸漸遠去，站點似乎安靜了下來，詛咒漸漸消散</Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission09_Event.c4>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission09_Event.c5>過去調查員們留下的陷阱控制住了敵人，抓住機會！</Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission09_Event.c5>
  <!--普罗米修斯-->
  <Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission10_Event.c1>這裡的敵人不像是苟延殘喘的殘黨，反而相當有組織性，務必小心</Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission10_Event.c1>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission10_Event.c2>無形的聲音鑽入你的耳中，如是問道：“這是最後的警告，不要打擾這裡的無形儀式，我們沒有商量的餘地”</Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission10_Event.c2>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission10_Event.c2.o1>這裡不應該是一群殘黨嗎，你們背後到底是什麼組織</Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission10_Event.c2.o1>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission10_Event.c2.o1.c1>“你的時間不多了”</Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission10_Event.c2.o1.c1>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission10_Event.c2.o2>我只是奉命消滅你們</Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission10_Event.c2.o2>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission10_Event.c2.o2.c1>"沒有加入我們是你此生最大的缺憾"</Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission10_Event.c2.o2.c1>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission10_Event.c2.o2.c1.o1>如果只是剛才那種水平的話，確實沒有加入的必要了。你們就這點人嗎</Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission10_Event.c2.o2.c1.o1>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission10_Event.c2.o2.c1.o1.c1>“我的軍隊和我的意志一樣強大”</Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission10_Event.c2.o2.c1.o1.c1>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission10_Event.c2.o3>別緊張，我只是恰好對無形之術很感興趣</Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission10_Event.c2.o3>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission10_Event.c2.o3.c1>“倘若如此，你願意成為無形之神的門徒嗎”</Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission10_Event.c2.o3.c1>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission10_Event.c2.o3.c1.o1>仰慕已久，請帶我逃脫肉體的桎梏（若未完成黑色夢中，則可概率跳過任務）</Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission10_Event.c2.o3.c1.o1>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission10_Event.c2.o3.c1.o1.c1>“你的誠意遠遠不夠……多麼可憐”</Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission10_Event.c2.o3.c1.o1.c1>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission10_Event.c2.o3.c1.o1.c2>“你的手上沾滿了門徒的鮮血……多麼可憐”</Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission10_Event.c2.o3.c1.o1.c2>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission10_Event.c2.o3.c1.o1.c3>“我的影響力正在擴大……你們可以走了”</Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission10_Event.c2.o3.c1.o1.c3>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission10_Event.c2.o3.c1.o2>我也僅僅停留在興趣的範疇，你們已經嚴重影響了人們的生存，像你這樣的謎語人，我已經清理掉幾十個了，勸你們還是早日伏法</Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission10_Event.c2.o3.c1.o2>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission10_Event.c2.o3.c1.o2.c1>當一種物質形態倒下時，我會以另一種物質形態顯現</Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission10_Event.c2.o3.c1.o2.c1>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission10_Event.c3>實驗結束，我的物質形態正在消退</Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission10_Event.c3>
  <!--破坏冲动-->
  <Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission11_Event.c1>站點裡的儀式魔法被強行啟動，似乎有什麼東西要來了</Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission11_Event.c1>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission11_Event.c3>他們的人數正在減少，一口氣將其消滅</Eventtext.Touhou_OutpostDestroyMission11_Event.c3>
  <!--卫星事件-->
  <Eventtext.Touhou_Kappa_Satellite_Event.c1>自從廢棄空間站在無光海原出現後，大部分河童都離開了站點，轉而去廢棄空間站周邊建立研究設施，只剩下少部分河童經營自己的商鋪。\n但面前這位似乎有著不一樣的事情要做。</Eventtext.Touhou_Kappa_Satellite_Event.c1>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_Kappa_Satellite_Event.c2>少女似乎正沉浸在手中的設計圖裡，完全沒注意到你的存在。</Eventtext.Touhou_Kappa_Satellite_Event.c2>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_Kappa_Satellite_Event.c2.o1>還是不打擾她了。</Eventtext.Touhou_Kappa_Satellite_Event.c2.o1>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_Kappa_Satellite_Event.c2.o2>禮貌地上前詢問。</Eventtext.Touhou_Kappa_Satellite_Event.c2.o2>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_Kappa_Satellite_Event.c2.o2.c1>“人類？”少女有些謹慎地抬頭看向你，“今天不營業，明天再來吧。”</Eventtext.Touhou_Kappa_Satellite_Event.c2.o2.c1>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_Kappa_Satellite_Event.c2.o1.c1.o1>“我對機械也略有研究，能讓我也看看那份圖紙嗎”</Eventtext.Touhou_Kappa_Satellite_Event.c2.o1.c1.o1>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_Kappa_Satellite_Event.c2.o1.c1.o1.c1>“離我們這麼近不怕被取走尻子玉嗎。”，少女正眼看了你一眼，隨後視線又落回設計圖上“本來是不缺幫手的，不過她們都去鳥船遺蹟附近了，要找新的零件變得很麻煩……”</Eventtext.Touhou_Kappa_Satellite_Event.c2.o1.c1.o1.c1>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_Kappa_Satellite_Event.c2.o1.c1.o1.c2>似乎是下定了某種決心，少女從口袋裡拿出一小塊黑色物件，似乎是某種定位器。“我們最近正在研發海底的通訊技術，但是一直沒有合適的材料，如果你找到了合適的材料，用這個探測器掃描一下，把礦脈地點發回來。”</Eventtext.Touhou_Kappa_Satellite_Event.c2.o1.c1.o1.c2>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_Kappa_Satellite_Event.c2.o1.c1.o1.c3>少女拿著探測器簡單按了幾個按鈕演示了一下用法，塞到了你的手裡“事成之後商品給你打九五折，期待你的好消息。”，說完，又自顧自地開始研究手裡的設計圖了。</Eventtext.Touhou_Kappa_Satellite_Event.c2.o1.c1.o1.c3>
  <!--完成任务后续-->
  <Eventtext.Touhou_Kappa_Satellite_Event.c2.o1.c2>“這麼快就找到了嗎”，少女有些意外，奪過你手裡的樣本礦石，用放大鏡仔細檢查了一會兒。</Eventtext.Touhou_Kappa_Satellite_Event.c2.o1.c2>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_Kappa_Satellite_Event.c2.o1.c3>“雖然離理想中差了不少，不過也勉強能用上嘛。”</Eventtext.Touhou_Kappa_Satellite_Event.c2.o1.c3>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_Kappa_Satellite_Event.c2.o1.c3.o1>這些材料究竟要用到什麼地方？</Eventtext.Touhou_Kappa_Satellite_Event.c2.o1.c3.o1>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_Kappa_Satellite_Event.c2.o1.c3.o1.c1>少女抬起拿著設計圖的手，一副複雜的設計方案展現在你面前。“其實也沒什麼大不了的，火箭計劃擱置後，聯盟的人沒有能力繼續這個項目，只好花請我們代工了。”</Eventtext.Touhou_Kappa_Satellite_Event.c2.o1.c3.o1.c1>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_Kappa_Satellite_Event.c2.o1.c3.o1.c2>少女收回了圖紙，“雖然大部分河童都沒什麼興趣，但畢竟收錢辦事，就算是磨洋工也要稍微認真一點，至少有了材料，後面的工作要輕鬆多了。”</Eventtext.Touhou_Kappa_Satellite_Event.c2.o1.c3.o1.c2>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_Kappa_Satellite_Event.c2.o1.c3.o1.c2.o1>火箭計劃？這種大工程竟然也要外包嗎</Eventtext.Touhou_Kappa_Satellite_Event.c2.o1.c3.o1.c2.o1>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_Kappa_Satellite_Event.c2.o1.c3.o1.c2.o1.c1>“準確來說我們只負責了一部分，這種東西要做得精細也太麻煩了……”，少女拿著筆，在設計圖邊緣空白處寫下了一個名字，送到你手裡“這個人之前參與過火箭項目，後來自己退出了項目，如果能把他請回來，我就輕鬆多啦。”</Eventtext.Touhou_Kappa_Satellite_Event.c2.o1.c3.o1.c2.o1.c1>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_Kappa_Satellite_Event.c2.o1.c3.o1.c2.o1.c1.o1>你自己怎麼不去？</Eventtext.Touhou_Kappa_Satellite_Event.c2.o1.c3.o1.c2.o1.c1.o1>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_Kappa_Satellite_Event.c2.o1.c3.o1.c2.o1.c1.o1.c1>“和人類交流很困難的，這樣吧，以後找我買東西，我都給你打九折”</Eventtext.Touhou_Kappa_Satellite_Event.c2.o1.c3.o1.c2.o1.c1.o1.c1>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_Kappa_Satellite_Event.c2.o1.c3.o2>找這些材料可費了我好大工夫，我現在更想要報酬</Eventtext.Touhou_Kappa_Satellite_Event.c2.o1.c3.o2>
  <Eventtext.Touhou_Kappa_Satellite_Event.c2.o1.c3.o2.c1>“給你打九五折還不夠嗎，真是貪心啊……”少女在手裡的設計圖上寫下一個名字，送到你手裡，“最近的火箭計劃忙得我頭疼，在海底天天這麼壓抑更頭疼了。你幫我找到這個人，這個人之前參與過火箭項目，後來自己退出了項目，如果能把他請回來，我就輕鬆多啦。”</Eventtext.Touhou_Kappa_Satellite_Event.c2.o1.c3.o2.c1>
</infotexts>